<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Global Winner - 120,000 tonnes Port Kembla/Redcar 1-10/4 $10.50 fio six days shinc Shinwa.</p>
<p>ORE - TBN 110,000 tonnes Tuburao/Hansaport 15-25/3 $7.35 fio 50,000 shinc/40,000 shinc.</p>
<p>Merchant Pilot - 55,000 tonnes bauxite Kamsar/Aughinish 2-9/3 $7.50 fio 24,000 shinc/15,000 shinc Guinomar.</p>
